/-!
# Monoidal category theory

Repository-owned extensions of Mathlib's monoidal-category theory. Monoidal
categories supply the base structure used by enriched categories. Compatibility
with triangulated structure is an additional interface, not an assumption on
all monoidal or all triangulated categories.
